sentences.text:
This criminal revision petition is directed against the judgment dated 29.08.2005 passed by the learned Additional Sessions Judge No.1, Jaipur City, Jaipur (for brevity "the learned Appellate Court") whereby, while partly allowing the Criminal Appeal No.30/2005 preferred by the petitioner and maintaining his conviction recorded by the learned Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate No.6, Jaipur City, Jaipur (for short "the learned trial Court") vide judgment dated 10.11.1999 in Case No.1565/99, the sentence awarded to him, has been modified as under:-
(i). Under Section 409 IPC:- One year's rigorous imprisonment and fine of 1,000/-;
in default thereof, two months' simple imprisonment.
